1a:["$","p",null,{"children":"Machines vibrate differently when something is wrong. This project uses accelerometer measurements to help distinguish normal operation from mechanical faults. I built a Python workflow and an interactive demo connecting sensor data, signal processing and machine learning. Compare real 25 RPM measurements with explicitly synthetic 50/75 RPM stress scenarios, inspect each decision and download traceable, clearly named CSVs."}]
